{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act43side_level_act43side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act43side",
  "stageId": "act43side_05",
  "title": "終將重逢",
  "storyCode": "AD-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1b0c3307faf9103e6dc7da78b93e8ce6c8270e60dc967fa07cf3d61b50f9dd81",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老道爾頓的死和謝莉小姐走入冷凍庫都不是意外……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在，邁克爾先生和瑪麗昂小姐也死了，還是死於那樣的場景和手段……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幕後的兇手到底是誰？為什麼要犯下這麼多樁命案？為什麼……如此殘忍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "邁克爾先生似乎早有預感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遇害的前一天晚上他來找我的時候，神情比前幾次見面還嚴肅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他一定是確定了道爾頓的意外背後真正的原因，才心驚膽戰想逃離這裡，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無論他是不是心裡有鬼，我們都沒辦法知道了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能最近發生的所有事都與他們口中說的那起五年前的意外有關，但我更擔心的是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兇手不再將謀殺掩蓋為意外，而是將自己的存在公之於眾，他難道是想告訴我們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在真相徹底被揭發之前，任何人都不安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊對不起，莫麗，我的話是不是嚇到你了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別擔心，無論地塊上是不是遊蕩著窮兇極惡的殺手，無論對方有多少人，我都會保護你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，蒂比大偵探，我只是在想……我也可以做些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "邁克爾先生已經遇難，但他之前拜託我的事情，不一定要作廢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格蕾塔女士曾提到的逃生艙或許已經被兇手盯上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果真的能另開闢一條逃生通道，或者製造出某種連接地面的裝置，又或者哪怕只是找到一個可以讓我們通過的排風口……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說不定我們真的能避開那個在陰影裡盯著我們的兇手，在關鍵時刻保護自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫麗……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蒂比，我來到這個劇組後，你是第一個跟我說話、第一個真心對待我的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我搞砸過很多事，也給你添過麻煩，但你凡事都擋在我的前面，哪怕瑪麗昂只是一時忘記我的名字，你也會鄭重地提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你一直在關心我、安慰我、保護我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在，我也想保護你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黎博利女孩輕輕抱住她在劇組裡最最要好的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等這些事情結束之後，我們到你家去看電影……二十四小時恐怖片連播，搭配我們最喜歡的飲料和炸鱗塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想看看你從小長大的地方，也想看看你溫柔的姐姐究竟是什麼樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我似乎打擾了你們溫馨的姐妹談心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米蘭妮女士，您怎麼會親自來道具間？您的助理呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們沒收到格蕾塔的終端通訊嗎？她清點並發放所有人的酬勞，正式解散了整個劇組。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畏懼兇手的、忌憚天災的、堅持拍攝的……都可以任意決定自己的去留，各行其是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眨眼的功夫，我手下那個軟骨頭就不知道跑去哪裡躲起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各行其是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有那麼多人遇害了……難道格蕾塔女士，不，劇組的其他人都不在意這背後深層的原因是什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "深層原因？在這種情況下難道還有人想要追尋真相嗎？直接逃離移動地塊去報警不是更方便嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者，按照格蕾塔的說法——把真相交給想當偵探的好事者吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那您來找我們又是為了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是你們，是你，布景噴畫師蒂比。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我欣賞格蕾塔想要拍攝天災的膽識，她的鋌而走險對我個人來說也是極佳的機遇，但戲不是光靠天然的背景就能撐起來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蒂比，我知道你對電影的熱情遠超劇組裡的大多數成員，你也多少聽說過這部戲對我有多麼重要……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，我真誠地請求你發揮在氣氛營造和色彩搭配上的天賦，為我的謝幕戲設計最完美的場景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是很願意啦，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蒂比，你去幫米蘭妮女士的忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦？莫麗，你穿上雨衣是要……你真的打算去，“探險”啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，我在道具組也待了這麼久，也算熟悉這個地塊，不會出什麼事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還記得我們剛剛說過的話嗎？這是我必須要去做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等我幫完米蘭妮女士，就去找你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請進，格蕾塔女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還沒開門就知道是我了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，我在等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那天你暗地裡調查出的小線索，讓我不得不提前向所有成員解釋拍攝實景天災的規劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不是個好時機。阿布納，還有劇組的其他人本就對我不滿，我只能臨時做出一些不小的決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果要認真計較，我甚至能以侵占他人財物罪將你告上法庭，盧西恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是我不會只為了樹立威信或是宣洩情緒懲罰我的員工，當時追究你的過錯毫無意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之後劇組又發生了命案，兇手甚至不再掩飾自己的暴行。大家驚慌失措，你卻還像往常一樣，遠離人群冷靜旁觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這樣的危機之中我才終於確認，你來這裡另有目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，這些都已經不重要了。劇組已經解散，無論你打算離開，還是留到合約結束，隨你心意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的戲份已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格蕾塔女士，此刻你來找我，恰好證明我的戲份還沒結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我沒辦法臨時變出另一個“杜邦夫人”，也沒辦法讓三個“洛克菲勒”死而復生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "時間和人手都已經所剩無幾，我必須在有限的資源下找出最好的解法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盧西恩先生，接下來，我想讓你來擔任主角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深夜的辦公室，粗暴的打字聲迴響著。\n滿臉頹喪的佩洛男子蜷縮在打字機前，他掃了一眼最新的那張劇稿，將菸頭按了上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "結局、結局、結局……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "杜邦夫人應該在結局死去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“她跟第二個洛克菲勒私奔後，兩人斷絕了所有與外界的聯絡，棲居在鄉野過著詩意的生活。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“然而貴族生活在洛克菲勒身上遺留的痕跡太重，他羞辱了杜邦夫人虛假的姓氏後離開了她，杜邦夫人在絕望中自刎……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太寫實……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "離開奢靡生活後一定要受罰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是哥倫比亞歷史中最重視財富為美德的時代啊！我要的是還原它，讓觀眾評價它，而不是自己在電影中批判它！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "菸頭燙出的傷痕吞沒了整張劇稿，斯蒂芬用力將灰燼吹走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“杜邦夫人最終沒有選擇任何一個洛克菲勒，她本就想藉戀人的名義逃脫虛假的命運，卻低估了愛情的毒性。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“洛克菲勒兄弟不約而同策劃了三種復仇方式，最終杜邦夫人被三人同時殺死……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太庸俗……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不做選擇依舊陷入愛情的泥沼，看似是某種因果和宿命，實際上只是牽強附會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最後杜邦夫人屍骨無存的畫面，確實具有一定的震撼力，但情節也太粗糙……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“杜邦夫人的家族冒充維多利亞貴族的真相最終還是暴露在公眾之前，無論三位洛克菲勒的愛有多深，他們都無法保護她免於制裁。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“杜邦夫人的人生中唯一一次真正享受貴族待遇的時刻，是真正的杜邦家族為她施加死刑之時……”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太……工整！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "精心編排，尋求表意，最後恰恰缺乏《杜邦夫人之死》裡該有的瘋狂和浪漫……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，怎麼稿紙又沒了，還得去文件櫃裡面拿……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斯蒂芬踩到被他丟在地上的紙團，摔個四腳朝天。\n這時他才意識到這間辦公室已經被他廢棄的劇稿淹沒，無處下腳。\n他躺在枯竭的靈感中央，雙手摀住臉，崩潰大吼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯蒂芬·奎你*藍卡塢片場術語*清醒一點！整整兩個月你都在修改結局，到現在連一個勉強能用的橋段都沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是你的原創劇本，是你一字一句斟酌出來的故事，難道最後你連自己想寫的是什麼都不知道嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果說痛苦才能孵化經典，現在不正是你應當走向創作巔峰的時刻嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拍攝即將結束的壓力，聽到即將拍攝天災的衝擊，兇手連環作案帶來的恐懼……什麼都有了！你還差什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“靈感之神”？哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那只是你敷衍格蕾塔女士的說辭……你的神不會來的，你們已經失聯很久了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……誰啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……只要能讓我想出結尾，是誰都可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
